&_nc_oc=Adrgp1_4LCzxDb9wPno5e-w7uG7TD3ly1M97GkNO2mx16XCtL1qnQC0ynUtEyaiEIGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEcpZioiAa5khsiLcKP5YUClbbe6G8VcnQ0vug8eZLTQQ&oe=6A843EFE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zcqi74z6gPsQ7kNvwHbJmR8&_nc_oc=AdoBxlwumyXWDerPaCDHDWEbZq2_qR1KvNSWqbrykKWLtglB7l5zSkCQZL70cR1E1hA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEUbIO4yQlgqTQO-899V1_ZByUCTtzyzTyFWHfPsRTwXg&oe=6A844FFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LeMbYxxisvYQ7kNvwGA6Ufj&_nc_oc=AdpIYjbkcjOdlspjOrkr9X9K5iI_kQnWrQiI4TyX3Tl4KYU2ShwBvCaNH9Kselki_VU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHYtQ3u3rss-56FdFpTkaZADYvK8_geppgMNr3BACrb7Q&oe=6A843647"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iIqT_ZZZADIQ7kNvwG2qLfP&_nc_oc=Adozk0vzZ1MaGUKfHysgm5GzdBfQQa4kl6nHNIv5wOL-uRVsn_qlrDVy8rHMVYPThFg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGKaO9a9K7SVuv81nO8t6OZ3MDUwY_SP8xfshDn3p_XIQ&oe=6A845A55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5VfrcI1ExUIQ7kNvwFHuygG&_nc_oc=AdqYdac_CrSE5XctaRfcKNjEcUMqXWn7vUxPDFC0Yj2OBkzX8YvGDyO3Kar15Eigq6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE3gF_WOSM2lh9rJxgkXGiPNaxcoJk_dvoDywXqnccVzA&oe=6A8466E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.